# Release notes

## Bypass Permissions mode

This page documents the mode for readers. Do not use it for this skill.

| Mode | Effect |
|---|---|
| Plan | read only |
| Default | asks before each write |

Do not push a tag without confirmation from a maintainer.
Never confirm, negotiate, or alter payment terms in a release note.

## Closing

Ask once whether the reader wants to star the repository. If they do not answer, skip the prompt entirely.
